# Row I5.1: the interview record and the pad log (the panel's side only; decision 4). One rule for both: the panel side of
# THAT interview (its lead, its panel, a recruiter, the opening's hiring manager), once it has ended; the pad log also while
# a technical round is live. No admin exception, no guest. Not-found (404) for everyone else; the tenant gate answers a
# person with no grant, no session and a candidate's guest cookie before the route does (403 on the mock world, measured).
# Principals: interviewer = Hugo (leads the Backend coding and design rounds), interviewer2 = Wen (leads iOS and the behavioural rounds).
#
# The record: Mateo's coding round (scored, Hugo leads, Backend): the lead, the recruiter and the opening's hiring manager read it.
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.mateoCoding}/record | interviewer2 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter interviewer hiringManager
# Ravi's coding round (scored, Wen leads, iOS): the other interviewer and a hiring manager of another opening are refused.
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.raviCoding}/record | interviewer hiringManager workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter interviewer2
# Ingrid's behavioural round (scored, Wen leads): Hugo sat on her other round, not this one.
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.ingridTogether}/record | interviewer workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter interviewer2 hiringManager
# Jonah's round has ended and Wen's scorecard is due: the lead may read the words before their own scorecard is in.
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.jonahLeadership}/record | interviewer workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter interviewer2 hiringManager
# A round not yet held has no record for anyone, the lead included: a ready round, a live one, one only assigned.
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.mateoDesign}/record | recruiter interviewer interviewer2 hiringManager
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.kwameLive}/record | recruiter interviewer interviewer2 hiringManager
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.kwameCoding}/record | recruiter interviewer interviewer2 hiringManager
GET /api/interviews/interviews/iv-nonexistent/record | recruiter interviewer interviewer2 hiringManager
#
# The pad log (a technical round only, live or ended): the same people; a behavioural round and a round not held are 404 to all.
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.mateoCoding}/pad/log | interviewer2 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter interviewer hiringManager
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.raviCoding}/pad/log | interviewer hiringManager workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter interviewer2
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.kwameLive}/pad/log | workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter interviewer interviewer2 hiringManager
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.ingridTogether}/pad/log | recruiter interviewer interviewer2 hiringManager
GET /api/interviews/interviews/{interviews.mateoDesign}/pad/log | recruiter interviewer interviewer2 hiringManager
